{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-meriva-collection-ellington-properties-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1433,"crm_id":"7606","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Meriva Collection","slug":"the-meriva-collection-ellington-properties-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Ellington Properties","price":2800000,"display_price":"2.8M","lattitude":25.313594323622,"longitude":55.320733407013,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3,5","about":"<p>The Meriva Collection Dubai is a design-led beachfront community by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-ellington-properties/\">Ellington Properties</a>, located on Island B within <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a>. Comprising six architecturally distinct buildings and 903 residences in Phase 1, known as Meriva Sunset, the development features <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside 3 and 5-bedroom penthouses</strong> in a low-density coastal setting.</p><p>The Meriva Collection Dubai Islands is thoughtfully arranged around pedestrianised pathways, meandering waterways, and landscaped gardens that lead directly to a private beachfront. With contemporary architecture, curated interiors, and resort-inspired amenities such as swimming pools, fitness stations, lagoon water features, and kids’ play areas, the project is positioned for high capital appreciation.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_6d537c74d3.jpg","hash":"Feature_6d537c74d3","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s