info":[{"id":9783,"answer":"<p>Yes, The Meriva Collection Dubai Islands is positioned in a limited beachfront supply zone on Island B, supporting long-term capital appreciation potential.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is The Meriva Collection a good investment?"},{"id":9784,"answer":"<p>The prices for residences in Meriva Collection Dubai Islands for sale begins from AED 2.8M.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the price of The Meriva Collection?"},{"id":9785,"answer":"<p>The Meriva Collection payment plan follows a structured 70/30 model with a 20% down payment, staged installments during construction and final payment on completion.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan of The Meriva Collection?"},{"id":9786,"answer":"<p>The Meriva Collection handover is scheduled for 2030.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is The Meriva Collection handover?"},{"id":9787,"answer":"<p>Yes, The Meriva Collection Dubai offers freehold ownership within Dubai Islands.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is The Meriva Collection freehold?"},{"id":9788,"answer":"<p>The Meriva Collection amenities include infinity pools, fitness pavilion, lagoon features, kids’ play zones, private cinema, and curated social spaces.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does The Meriva Collection offer?"},{"id":9789,"answer":"<p>Meriva Collection apartments include 1, 2, and 3-bedroom layouts, alongside 3 and 5-bedroom penthouses.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What unit types are available in The Meriva Collection?"},{"id":9790,"answer":"<p>The Meriva Collection location offers private beachfront access on Island B with direct connectivity to Sheikh Zayed Road (E11).<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes The Meriva Collection location unique?"},{"id":9791,"answer":"<p>The Meriva Collection floor plan features open-plan interiors, expansive terraces, floor-to-ceiling glazing, and waterfront-oriented layouts.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What does The Meriva Collection floor plan include?"},{"id":9792,"answer